# SentinelLake MVP Design

## Objective
Build a Databricks Security & Observability Accelerator capable of monitoring user access activities and pipeline risks using Databricks metadata sources.

## Inputs
### system.access.audit
Used for:
- User activity monitoring
- Access tracking
- Permission changes
- Authentication events

### system.lakeflow.jobs
Used for:
- Job monitoring
- Workflow status tracking

### system.lakeflow.job_run_timeline
Used for:
- Failure detection
- Execution duration analysis

### Unity Catalog
Used for:
- Permission information
- Sensitive dataset identification
- Governance context

## Processing Layer

### Risk Scoring Engine
Rules:
- After-hours access → +20
- Sensitive dataset access → +25
- Permission change → +15
- Job failure → +10
- Large export → +30

## Outputs
### Incident Records
Example:
User: abc@company.com
Risk Score: 85
Severity: Critical

### Dashboard
Displays:
- High-risk users
- Recent incidents
- Job failures
- Risk trends

## Future Enhancements
- AI Incident Summaries
- Advanced Anomaly Detection
- Real-Time Alerting
- Data Quality Monitoring
